#: scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01bc96cf1ad590725f998f4d17cdbeab877930e38c2964bc157f101132488dee
#. default-sha256: 0452501e50db160c633a2106c94a2b8f0c1cc3341bd7ea66b13d0c2161d4f5f9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And that marked the true beginning of their quiet days together in "
"the dark mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫E isso marcou o verdadeiro início de seus dias tranquilos juntos na "
"escura mansão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 812538d5d822bee6a4b1f311e290f8faffce4d32c5e71d040621421629df77b1
#. default-sha256: 897686d922dba67b1e0ff2f2a1dfcbbe06efb0eff6fb37c127d572aba65a3812
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They acknowledged and accepted each other’s presence, no longer isolating themselves, but "
"actively, regularly conversing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles reconheceram e aceitaram a presença um do outro, não mais se isolando, mas ativa e "
"regularmente conversando."

#: scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 736537aa8c12dd1049e416c74aa6e791e18dbf852b2fa433c3d14b4a736afe6a
#. default-sha256: 8995a037511636123428b08dc13e0faf5d5c50b33a3191c1ad4e5da84d1dcfc5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As mundane as it might seem, it was something they had been unable to attain until then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por mais mundano que possa parecer, era algo que eles não conseguiram alcançar até então."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c58f77bac8f7336810bee681e62a72b8ddfed13f00a8e2b66221fb59b4106b1
#. default-sha256: 7b9f7be70fb1bf1004b080b55741d0318c77eee1d4b7bb7f59cd15d3c89c31ab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they were still somewhat fumbling around in the dark with one another, drawing "
"closer and pushing away again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, eles ainda estavam um pouco atrapalhados no escuro um com o outro, se "
"aproximando e se afastando novamente."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6b579808c8f7423ba372e8bd3dedb2cd0be9037433c83ce8314750127372c4c
#. default-sha256: 7d93b5ec43188858a31b20745d6dab19b1ae4b1324bf174d72ec15d38c6bb72e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel, in his own ungraceful way, was beginning to open himself up to the things she said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel, à sua maneira deselegante, estava começando a se abrir para as coisas que ela dizia,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da33bc8fdd00812e7ff064a77f339bbbb1ec1732476f6290eb7b1866e4b53e73
#. default-sha256: 6a8a3cbd79762086feaa0700c5687a5340185c41d7fbc35bc02abd7075af856e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the White-Haired Girl was beginning to smile with greater frequency."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e a Garota de Cabelos Brancos começava a sorrir com mais frequência."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b092327964999e87bd727637c2b81fbe21c753cfde468d9a82c7f6a792142ac
#. default-sha256: a41c96afdafe8cd9337f83018ddc3c5f10715d6f16634edb87f26246ec518019
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had taken to dining together, and her wish of learning to read was being granted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eles começaram a jantar juntos, e seu desejo de aprender a ler estava sendo atendido."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54991729210a284b9fd34be8c7d44691b2d9730418f5e37d868b580bd7e665a6
#. default-sha256: 6a827a9b4414be43ed56bf5174681d9e810ea687a62f02e43ccd16c8ff779d74
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He taught her in the feeble light of a candle placed upon the table, the two sitting across "
"from one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele a ensinou à luz fraca de uma vela colocada sobre a mesa, os dois sentados um de frente "
"para o outro."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a5ccdf4f3ec768069bb3e9e41ea1323413b7e6fb8c2b3ffd5363fbfdfdb00e3
#. default-sha256: f6e5bdc699a96305e3a30f173aff8c30854ba48e8ba90d7d1020b10e57c0e572
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Michel seemed to be well educated, he had not been instructed in the art of teaching, "
"so he found the process quite grueling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora Michel parecesse ser bem educado, ele não havia sido instruído na arte de ensinar, "
"então achou o processo bastante cansativo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f76a7b3536844cf085466e2604b5c04f213b3f4bf77030212f7cf87e5642d708
#. default-sha256: 4573cedfd1c442eeda5853f99f7d1e87ccc5fd34db6c3b9f505222ec8571e4b8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to the White-Haired Girl, the longer it took the better;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫her primary objective "
"was, after all, to spend time with him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas para a Garota de Cabelos Brancos, quanto mais demorasse, melhor;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫seu objetivo "
"principal era, afinal, passar tempo com ele."

#: scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67c5d8504ac23f31fe7deebf255b31f4f0e9ea4843701703c49a3138cbbd43d4
#. default-sha256: 1c45425ac3b08cc437c3805320cd5b2cc0f0a86f71a5e992f83b2c9ea1970121
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The days passed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Os dias se passaram,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7713280fb86b1299837a5822b9a600f3a9eec218d48a517453cc316da3d459bf
#. default-sha256: 5c54811b41db3e1b95e0c443afebf593f40a59646dca974a1af143c982a3cc16
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and eventually, she reached the point where her comprehension was adequate enough without "
"assistance. ⟪k:1⟫Her next request, then, was for them to read through a book together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e, eventualmente, ela chegou ao ponto em que sua compreensão era adequada o suficiente sem "
"assistência. ⟪k:1⟫Seu próximo pedido, então, foi que eles lessem um livro juntos."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aac1f3f7f91410098c0d410a3df99a4fb0455e8ced9ab1e620e23faaa72c2818
#. default-sha256: 486fc0e6817f90b34f6dd65f2c830cc1cf1d9ff30168ecf8bc6ffedee40b0be4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Have you read every book in the library?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você já leu todos os livros da biblioteca?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3cb8a415cfa70ea2d9754a74ebad831e92448625c53cd317b8ded1f4eeb68f6
#. default-sha256: 901ecb276b3a4294cefb85c7926e2dc28bf3f5acf7ce8e3e62d52c4334761be8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No... ⟪k:5⟫I stopped looking at them after a while."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Não...⟪k:5⟫Parei depois de um tempo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2fd3d613c36bc9b298997cf5cfa948ef2730f0f2626d8842316652b7976cdba
#. default-sha256: a4a3e97e612b1885386755bb52bf57d7678326bf3ead365dab199e566fbbf4cb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Most everything I’m sent is dull, uninformative dreck.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The diary of a lord... "
"⟪k:4⟫Foolish make-believe tales..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quase tudo que me mandam é lixo maçante e pouco informativo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O diário de um "
"lorde...⟪k:4⟫Histórias tolas de faz de conta..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f457146f9e5ac5f70d5a93918e6e6c1b90203de14b75ffd390510a17ab7fea4
#. default-sha256: 8135795304f144c2ac95d9651fd718159159cf5230209be391e9cb31fb654b28
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re not fond of fiction, I take it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você não gosta de ficção, imagino?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1062b1fb368e8b0a1ac41094743d97d48e216b0fe9090a5ea851126598e3a1f2
#. default-sha256: ebbef1ee7dfc2597c4daaa5533c5933c0636b28f6e204bdf27e33e4ccdd42251
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What value is there in the lies and fantasies of another?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que valor há nas mentiras e fantasias de outro?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f768594496a59976ff9c70be5fa526bea7ee56b6a94c28f6e75232631d40441
#. default-sha256: 1b24bac46e420111a2ed5371854dc2fd33d6580c7230249650da8364869c7ab2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Stories... ⟪k:1⟫can be invigorating.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tales of adventure can take you places you "
"could never go."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Histórias...⟪k:1⟫podem ser revigorantes.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Contos de aventura podem levá-lo a lugares "
"que você nunca poderia ir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ec18a4396d9c7b3a430d53e11ea2d4e95c03487beb780c8de6d86c20fe606d
#. default-sha256: 77fd9bab13532d31628e08bea225766f3654289ffb359562e348d586503bd341
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Legends of heroes, folklore, stories of otherworldly phenomena.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They can be "
"terrifying, and they can be exhilarating."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lendas de heróis, folclore, histórias de fenômenos sobrenaturais.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eles podem ser "
"aterrorizantes, e podem ser emocionantes."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a011800872700a00a3c1752c93b5108ff28d0840435d5dda28cd4467a2a8a13
#. default-sha256: 450433c54dac2144a997cd823e680c433c903599ddd74ad941cd9cb83fcab3e1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They may not be real, but they give you a little glimpse into the author’s heart—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"let you feel like you’re seeing the same thing they saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles podem não ser reais, mas dão a você um pequeno vislumbre do coração do autor—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"permitem que sinta que está vendo a mesma coisa que eles viram."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 151cb1550002dd06134ff00ccc06c99cb2c9255728116ad6c363ee6971420798
#. default-sha256: 5876f6324ca2d44a7bc719b08e61cda40e4492dc4659524f997562c14df0d20e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...You are a very empathetic girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fiction inspires nothing of the sort in me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Você é uma garota muito empática.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A ficção não inspira nada disso em mim."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3c2153862d7e49a96470317bf66cbde2d7ffde3bfb849293e25001e776b5df8
#. default-sha256: 2c4085ae33d925775895e7e31ad36d776a53f1dc21480eda91402cc8bb02c98a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No entanto..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5690e73b8c8b448b702b13ac928ed48a1881bdf78f40e765ef9cc497e889cd61
#. default-sha256: 246d574dc691bc84929b488fd05f4439f40e261ff1da52ce090908fe9d2df18c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F934972B_8D87_4A6F_9D42_88AA60C16AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d0574d43203d5c72e56e61696c273959faeef07672f052c11acd5cf92b58f18
#. default-sha256: bf13dde9f39ad037e1220023710c931eec316e3ff03307c7e33b88c1c0cb0fd1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F934972B_8D87_4A6F_9D42_88AA60C16AD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps long ago... ⟪k:1⟫it may have been able to,⟪k:2⟫though I can no longer remember what "
"it feels like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Talvez há muito tempo...⟪k:1⟫posso ter sido capaz,⟪k:2⟫embora eu não consiga mais lembrar "
"como é."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B35B874F_18F8_4245_9D80_D44806C2377C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75780657995be225aa07c8c17ba7b4d85b0585e947d5880a4e5bf0bf164083dc
#. default-sha256: 6141905d8b2a9490ed34813566ea98e70661dc1a7a54c3119f0843ee96b1d685
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B35B874F_18F8_4245_9D80_D44806C2377C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sure it’ll come back to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tenho certeza que vai conseguir novamente."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E37506A1_9251_4FE8_8FB8_A62B9DC8A983
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0cdd8b6e612ae28bc4742675055a5f38ccaf249ac572404cb66449f43f912ad
#. default-sha256: 74102b8e584d1dd258c90135cd830924d3983931377f948c64e9c42d4fd55665
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E37506A1_9251_4FE8_8FB8_A62B9DC8A983"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re not an empty man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você não é um homem vazio."

#: scenario4:scenario4_747C91DA_C801_4642_8DDE_EC008C3BCB03
