"⟪k:0⟫The witch was sentenced to death, and as the fire blazed around her, smoke rose high into "
"the air. ⟪k:1⟫The smoke soon became rainclouds, blessing the village with an end to the drought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A bruxa foi condenada à morte e, enquanto o fogo ardia ao redor dela, a fumaça subia no ar. "
"⟪k:1⟫A fumaça logo se transformou em nuvens de chuva, abençoando a aldeia com o fim da seca."

