"⟪k:0⟫What I don’t understand, though...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is why the witch is said to grant people’s "
"wishes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas o que eu não entendo...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫é o por quê se diz que a bruxa concede os desejos das "
"pessoas."

#: scenario4:scenario4_09B4A17E_5E4B_4F1F_93E8_A5EF858E0083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab7f834b9ec9715155a98a13e0967a83464360e685cea8918197921e6cd88ec3
