"⟪k:0⟫A história da bruxa despertou o interesse da Garota de Cabelos Brancos, inspirando-a a se "
"conduzir para satisfazer essa curiosidade."

#: scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 334d3f1ddb191dcef01ba9b14768aab99a62acdc7ca5ae8a06e1c0a1349f6895
#. default-sha256: 53ca255005e06ce9d0808618488159ad35cd1b0cc635f4c4040a3ce8c8df0291
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57214629_ED20_4FA1_88F5_3167DDEF3496"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, been accused of being a witch herself, so she undoubtedly felt an "
"affinity to the legend."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela tinha, afinal, sido acusada de ser uma bruxa, então sem dúvida sentia uma afinidade com "
"a lenda."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a08e1dda57917c7c6477648b9ca84fcf7a0919b78f19bd9f6ce5d8e988d0590
#. default-sha256: e2ee33a850dac42b5b32479ee655d6d65b321ee66e203a6acedf1b084f0a8ecf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4ADAC2C0_C8CF_4270_BF39_562E6746F0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What a sweet girl she was.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que menina doce ela era.⟪k:1⟫"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afb3dd64e98e095663c72abf4751f586e4e01679fbc7b6f21372063323d64f7c
#. default-sha256: 50acb2f5fcee7ffe4caf7b1980c08ea8ed4c271f48a70607550a11344926b5f3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49AB0168_0BFF_4FA2_8EE8_7FD96A89692B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With Michel in the lead, the two climbed a long, long spiral staircase. ⟪k:1⟫There were many "
"more stairs than the White-Haired Girl had anticipated, and she soon found herself short of "
"breath."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com Michel na liderança, os dois subiram uma longa escada em espiral. ⟪k:1⟫Havia muito mais "
"escadas do que a Garota de Cabelos Brancos havia previsto, e ela logo se viu com falta de ar."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 567c1abff999c1fd4baef8604765a8203bc56f88f3a3fcea4194cc7b3f04c10f
#. default-sha256: f57e52a2cf473e371c5ba09f21b3b6285263779977cbf298d6fdbc674a6a0941
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BFE8A313_D7D2_46CD_9BF9_FB338F656C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rectangular windows were carved out of the stone in regular intervals.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Peering "
"through one of them, she could see a village in the distance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A pleasantly cool, high-"
"altitude breeze brushed across her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Janelas retangulares foram esculpidas na pedra em intervalos regulares.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Espiando "
"através de uma delas, ela podia ver uma aldeia ao longe.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Uma brisa agradavelmente fresca "
"da elevada altitude roçou seu rosto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7642f0fa8cd5770364431e755ca514c906caef766578fd72bf03de03d2a32b89
#. default-sha256: 4e5ef624e92e0675f90b387d1b3a02752d5cb6700cb7dafa5c403ba804984463
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After much climbing, they finally arrived at the top, where a door made of "
"partially rotted wood stood. ⟪k:3⟫Michel pulled open the door,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Depois de muita escalada, finalmente chegaram ao topo, onde havia uma porta de "
"madeira parcialmente apodrecida. ⟪k:3⟫Michel abriu a porta,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebdba281ce96eabe5b98fa41c056fd527d60c3fa1d09182a47859c28f53a1d5a
#. default-sha256: 7a46ba707f3216cc9df51556202a5b0829e34a00ca6ad79e3b0e3390a96f5a7b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫revealing a small room with no windows or doors in sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫revelando uma pequena sala sem janelas ou portas à vista."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c45640b7b91cc0df9219fe3a8e4e84edc4a1521caa5d527df0fb69a7b1fd331d
#. default-sha256: 13f8e24e7cb3b64f10701a7549bd926a46a258b6dda11308cd7bac618fae6bbf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is... ⟪k:3⟫the top of the tower?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Isto é...⟪k:3⟫o topo da torre?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 482663eeee953304206d2e10154d477ceea7ed580a86f894fb4cf2e31a5c1649
#. default-sha256: 142ee64bfe714db845b7660cdf687c9e0e5552aa72375e3c4e48842f28bc2dda
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being called an “observation” tower,⟪k:1⟫you could hardly observe anything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Apesar de ser chamada de torre de “observação”,⟪k:1⟫você dificilmente poderia observar "
"qualquer coisa de lá."

#: scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b09ca53d7748189b0d2023ec485cd087dbb24938fc7ecf229b6149f9ca5f9896
#. default-sha256: cee292dffac7f799a168ad9ae6da62875ff535cc14f26613cc63a284dd74baa5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her face contorted in confusion, the White-Haired Girl threw her gaze about the room. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Glancing up, she saw only a darkened ceiling—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com o rosto contorcido em confusão, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos lançou seu olhar ao redor da "
"sala. ⟪k:1⟫Olhando para cima, ela viu apenas um teto escuro—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69642c9d0a551f0b2bab30fcf91f6779f7355e70c6d4d52582592952251e648a
#. default-sha256: d941f53a4332f53b71ef2ccfc147eab60694ad40b6de3a3753322ef8907243ae
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and, slightly below it, a single small window through which shone a little ray of light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e, um pouco abaixo dele, uma única janelinha por onde brilhava um pequeno raio de luz."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a030f4f419f5e80a6490301326e2451489a43d0825ca37df47fb7a37e9262a5
#. default-sha256: 178fb4ff0879cbd7f2100c79c6b52af2cb6180eb2a9f6aeea256bab6a29b3287
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beam cleaved through the darkness like the sharpened blade of a beautiful sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O raio atravessou a escuridão como a lâmina afiada de uma bela espada."

#: scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2c511131a008f928b575a266086ecc84b0dd450d473dbb685448e3ed3484d3b
#. default-sha256: 16cd34f19181e314cfffbe6d2283439d50f5a81965fa4994f79a44dd94c84db0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness draped over the rest of the room only served to make more impressive that "
"solitary ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A escuridão que cobria o resto da sala só serviu para tornar mais impressionante aquele "
"solitário raio de luz."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4de8c70055cb868c85c7e0363bb322a611a459d0de2a3ae25866d37f2bbb2d5
#. default-sha256: 6c91e27d9387bc4a01b3017f4f2f261e1cc7b2302393343d3fe9d7183104e857
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had a magical, fairy-tale quality to it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tinha uma qualidade mágica, de conto de fadas."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9f998bb4d47c1ee139dc9fc76b1b10f5d6a88157357a8c4e8d67a76c6b0cbb1
#. default-sha256: fca7f898d13959bd5a9c19b95cede78405984447714053a957f47690d8ec255e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As if being pulled in by it, she drew toward the light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Como se estivesse sendo puxada, ela se aproximou da luz."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a06e8c943c0d49feb287e3ba094b0029c36be1468d4ab06b41285424c9d9dd53
#. default-sha256: 9a4a24e807c62667f88ce0eeaba562f8c0e00b7a9a3bab70a54f300a720a1e8a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect there was once a large window in this room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you look closely, you can "
"see seams in the stone of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu suspeito que havia uma grande janela nesta sala.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se você olhar de perto, poderá "
"ver costuras na pedra da parede."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39e3605a2e70230c687576fa41f1fdc718d5f2a350a974bb30d358e3a553bca9
#. default-sha256: 3d01460e0a51cc68eb43f363cb6e418cf4c20c31e281029d5d2a936fd419dd7c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of the stone differs slightly on either side of the seams.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume "
"something caused them to seal off the window⟪k:3⟫after it was built."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A cor da pedra difere ligeiramente em ambos os lados das costuras.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu presumo que "
"alguma coisa os fez selar a janela⟪k:3⟫depois de construída."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 780e42e181cce03cb4638b38cdc38c404d00f69ce0f3f06d18f670119f8371ef
#. default-sha256: 4cda41f367c9e73d262fff65b8d22cab8fa97e9843ef1a844c1ccb814fe25cdd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though I don’t know what that something... ⟪k:1⟫might... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Embora eu não saiba o que essa coisa...⟪k:1⟫poderia...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ser..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ebe2ebb55a2f791e5f3bc1431fb09be6054a6264543ca3a27ba9704e12be714
#. default-sha256: 8fae2c439dc0eeafb624226b9f1e11d40fc564f60411206f15bf7867e6c7aea3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫When Michel’s eyes fell upon the White-Haired Girl "
"wrapped in that beam of light, he sputtered to a stop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Quando os olhos de Michel caíram sobre a Garota de "
"Cabelos Brancos envolta naquele feixe de luz, ele desajeitadamente parou."

#: scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40d0cf65e71804125a7f93750eab52ce903c260e3dbdc8cd9b0770091211bbce
#. default-sha256: 023f5ba7df926464c01a849280ae4275d9ccbf1da586333f437367ce251d37fc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man who never flinched at anything—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who had long since distanced himself from "
"such stirrings of the heart—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was utterly bewitched."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O homem que nunca vacilava para nada—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫que há muito se distanciou de tais agitações "
"do coração–⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫estava completamente enfeitiçado."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54dbabf8505ecfb177b3176709f19aed09205d8ed7a145016959a871e74b7dfe
#. default-sha256: defd805f9a1a0244d747fb16d77dcac9c0ecacebfb9641d3cdf8b05ff98c18b8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never seen her illuminated so vividly before, and he was having a great deal of "
"trouble finding the words to describe her striking beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele nunca a tinha visto iluminada de forma tão vívida antes, e estava tendo muita "
"dificuldade em encontrar as palavras para descrever sua impressionante beleza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9f7b1621b05ac81f2d9a5de6861bc0b7356436067ec8f133131c78f921106d
#. default-sha256: 2e8673878f76cb4d06af623fdc1f634d919554790cdc3c2d100674099e032f24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For someone who had been chased out of her home and accused of being a witch, the White-"
"Haired Girl looked less like a practitioner of the dark arts,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Para alguém que foi expulsa de sua casa e acusada de ser bruxa, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos "
"parecia menos uma praticante das artes das trevas,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE28FDA0_6292_4AA1_B783_8C17C869EBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35888233602a9227e075192fdbf9f4c772e87be1f9da98d30c1278cfcb2be8e0
