msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5673b19446890b1a5994f00614554f2291f07af8d43092a95447c83343735f3b
#. default-sha256: ed6842a199bd213a2ec327c1add1e0bffe823c5f850ea7b71a51397902ad590e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel undoubtedly felt the same way, for his gaze was affixed firmly upon her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel, sem dúvida, sentiu o mesmo, pois seu olhar estava fixo nela."

